  'This disproves the arbitrary-level K2P disjointness statement in Lemma 5.6 and the K2P part of Corollary 5.8 of Brits and collaborators’ Version 2, which were removed in Version 3. Since K2P is a submodel of K3P, the same example gives a negative answer to both high-level Kimura trinet-disjointness questions stated in Version 3.',
